WEBVTT

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:01.184
is helping or harming you,

00:14:01.208 --> 00:14:04.101
puts you back in the driver's seat.

00:14:04.125 --> 00:14:09.000
It gives you some control
over your decision-making.

00:14:10.792 --> 00:14:12.643
Three strategies.

00:14:12.667 --> 00:14:13.917
Pretty simple.

00:14:14.875 --> 00:14:17.476
They're readily available to us all,

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:20.351
anytime, anywhere.

00:14:20.375 --> 00:14:23.643
They don't require rocket science.

00:14:23.667 --> 00:14:27.059
Resilience isn't some fixed trait.

00:14:27.083 --> 00:14:28.351
It's not elusive,

00:14:28.375 --> 00:14:31.292
that some people have
and some people don't.